msgid "Growing sight: each player sees only the land around their own pieces."
msgstr "逐步扩展的视野：每位玩家只能看到自己棋子周围的陆地。"

msgid "Numbers hidden until you discover them"
msgstr "数字在你发现之前保持隐藏"

msgid "Settler"
msgstr "拓荒者"

msgid "Settlers at the start"
msgstr "开局时的拓荒者"

msgid "Most settlers per player"
msgstr "每位玩家最多拓荒者数"

msgid "Settlers leave after the first settlements"
msgstr "拓荒者在首批村庄建成后离开"

msgid "Turn off to keep settlers in the game: players can buy more, and they gather and guard."
msgstr "关闭后拓荒者会留在游戏中：玩家可以购买更多拓荒者，它们会采集资源并守护。"

msgid "Settlers gather"
msgstr "拓荒者采集资源"

msgid "A settler standing still takes one card from each hex around it on its numbers: 3 for the first settler, 11 for the second, 2 or 12 for the third."
msgstr "静止的拓荒者在掷出其数字时，从周围每个六边形拿取一张卡：第一个拓荒者是 3，第二个是 11，第三个是 2 或 12。"

msgid "Cards a settler gathers per hex"
msgstr "拓荒者每个六边形采集的卡牌数"

msgid "Settlers guard against the robber"
msgstr "拓荒者抵御强盗"

msgid "The robber cannot move onto a hex with a settler on one of its corners."
msgstr "强盗不能移动到某个路口上有拓荒者的六边形。"


msgid "Ages"
msgstr "时代"

msgid "Big with ages"
msgstr "大岛与时代"

msgid "Start from"
msgstr "起始类型"

msgid "Save the rules you like with the box at the bottom to use them again with one click."
msgstr "用底部的输入框保存你喜欢的规则，下次一键使用。"

msgid "Megacities count as cities."
msgstr "超级城市也算城市。"

msgid "Age that unlocks each building"
msgstr "解锁每种建筑的时代"

msgid "Ages: players advance to the Age of the Sea and the Golden Age"
msgstr "时代：玩家进入海洋时代和黄金时代"

msgid "Age of the Sea (II): cost"
msgstr "海洋时代（II）：费用"

msgid "Age of the Sea (II): seconds of research"
msgstr "海洋时代（II）：研究秒数"

msgid "Age of the Sea (II): cities needed"
msgstr "海洋时代（II）：所需城市"

msgid "Age of the Sea (II): points needed"
msgstr "海洋时代（II）：所需分数"

msgid "Age of the Sea (II): points it gives"
msgstr "海洋时代（II）：获得分数"

msgid "Age of the Sea (II): extra fish per building on a fishing ground"
msgstr "海洋时代（II）：渔场每座建筑额外的鱼"

msgid "Age of the Sea (II): extra cards kept safe on a 7"
msgstr "海洋时代（II）：掷出 7 时额外安全手牌"

msgid "Age of the Sea (II): build time (%)"
msgstr "海洋时代（II）：建造时间（%）"

msgid "Golden Age (III): cost"
msgstr "黄金时代（III）：费用"

msgid "Golden Age (III): seconds of research"
msgstr "黄金时代（III）：研究秒数"

msgid "Golden Age (III): cities needed"
msgstr "黄金时代（III）：所需城市"

msgid "Golden Age (III): points needed"
msgstr "黄金时代（III）：所需分数"

msgid "Golden Age (III): points it gives"
msgstr "黄金时代（III）：获得分数"

msgid "Golden Age (III): extra fish per building on a fishing ground"
msgstr "黄金时代（III）：渔场每座建筑额外的鱼"

msgid "Golden Age (III): extra cards kept safe on a 7"
msgstr "黄金时代（III）：掷出 7 时额外安全手牌"

msgid "Golden Age (III): build time (%)"
msgstr "黄金时代（III）：建造时间（%）"

msgid "Megacities too."
msgstr "超级城市也算。"

msgid "Largest Population: points"
msgstr "最多人口：分数"

msgid "Age of the Sea (II): extra cards per settlement on each roll"
msgstr "海洋时代（II）：每次掷骰每个村庄额外的牌"

msgid "Age of the Sea (II): extra cards per city on each roll"
msgstr "海洋时代（II）：每次掷骰每座城市额外的牌"

msgid "Golden Age (III): extra cards per settlement on each roll"
msgstr "黄金时代（III）：每次掷骰每个村庄额外的牌"

msgid "Golden Age (III): extra cards per city on each roll"
msgstr "黄金时代（III）：每次掷骰每座城市额外的牌"

msgid "Age from which fish buy off the robber"
msgstr "从哪个时代起可以用鱼打发强盗"

msgid "Uses the robber's fish ransom setting."
msgstr "使用强盗的以鱼赎买设置。"

msgid "Age from which settlers gather"
msgstr "从哪个时代起拓荒者开始采集"

msgid "Age from which settlers keep the robber away"
msgstr "从哪个时代起拓荒者能挡住强盗"

msgid "The big island for 5 or 6 players, with ages. 17 points."
msgstr "适合 5 或 6 名玩家的大岛，带时代。17 分。"

msgid "Settlers with ages"
msgstr "拓荒者与时代"

msgid "Settlers stay on the island; they gather from the Age of the Sea and keep the robber away from the Golden Age. 14 points."
msgstr "拓荒者留在岛上；从海洋时代起采集，从黄金时代起挡住强盗。14 分。"

msgid "Quick ages"
msgstr "快速时代"

msgid "Fish that buy off the robber (0 = off)"
msgstr "打发强盗所需的鱼（0 = 关闭）"

msgid "Friendly robber"
msgstr "友好的强盗"

msgid "Hidden island to explore"
msgstr "需要探索的隐藏岛屿"

msgid "Settlers and ages on a hidden island: explore to find land and fishing grounds. 14 points."
msgstr "隐藏岛屿上的拓荒者与时代：探索以找到土地和渔场。14 分。"

msgid "Points for Longest Road / Largest Army / Largest Population"
msgstr "最长道路 / 最大军队 / 最多人口的分数"

msgid "The classic island with ages: pay fish to reach the Age of the Sea and the Golden Age for points, a bigger safe hand, faster builds and the megacity. 14 points."
msgstr "带时代的经典岛屿：用鱼进入海洋时代和黄金时代，获得分数、更高的安全手牌上限、更快的建造和超级城市。14 分。"

msgid "Ages (Age of the Sea, Golden Age)"
msgstr "时代（海洋时代、黄金时代）"

msgid "The classic island, but the robber leaves alone anyone with fewer than 3 points, and what it takes goes back to the bank."
msgstr "经典岛屿，但强盗不会打扰少于 3 分的玩家，抢走的牌回到银行。"

msgid "Fast dice and builds with ages: the Age of the Sea needs no city and research is shorter. 10 points."
msgstr "带时代的快速骰子和建造：海洋时代不需要城市，研究更短。10 分。"

msgid "Explorers of the ages"
msgstr "时代探险家"

msgid "Points before the robber can rob you (0 = always)"
msgstr "强盗可以抢你之前需要的分数（0 = 总是）"

msgid "Settlers stay after the first settlements"
msgstr "拓荒者在首批村庄之后留下"

msgid "Each player sees only the numbers next to their own buildings or under their own settlers, not the ones other players find."
msgstr "每位玩家只能看到自己建筑旁或自己开拓者所在处的数字，看不到其他玩家发现的数字。"

msgid "Age of the Sea (II)"
msgstr "海洋时代（II）"

msgid "Golden Age (III)"
msgstr "黄金时代（III）"

msgid "Start with the classic game. The variations you can add when you create a game, such as ages, settlers or a hidden island, have their own page."
msgstr "先从经典玩法开始。创建对局时可以添加的变体，例如时代、开拓者或隐藏岛屿，有单独的页面。"

msgid "Classic game"
msgstr "经典玩法"

msgid "The classic island during a game: hexes with numbers, harbors, settlements and roads."
msgstr "对局中的经典岛屿：带数字的六边形、港口、村庄和道路。"

msgid "The island: each hex gives a resource when its number is rolled."
msgstr "岛屿：掷出某个六边形的数字时，它就产出资源。"

msgid "The bottom bar: your resources and the build and trade buttons."
msgstr "底部栏：你的资源以及建造和交易按钮。"

msgid "Your resources and the buttons to build, buy developments and trade."
msgstr "你的资源，以及建造、购买发展卡和交易的按钮。"

msgid "Variations"
msgstr "变体"

msgid "Hidden island"
msgstr "隐藏岛屿"

msgid "More rules"
msgstr "更多规则"

msgid "Pick them under Custom when you create a game. Everything from the classic game still applies; these rules are added on top."
msgstr "创建对局时在“自定义”中选择。经典玩法的规则依然有效，这些规则是额外添加的。"

msgid "Each player shows their age next to their name; the Age II button sits under the build buttons."
msgstr "每位玩家的名字旁显示其时代；“时代 II”按钮位于建造按钮下方。"

msgid "Your age shows next to your name; the age button is under the build buttons."
msgstr "你的时代显示在名字旁；时代按钮在建造按钮下方。"

msgid "Each player advances on their own, as in a real-time strategy game: pay the cost, wait while you research, and the new age brings points and advantages. Games with ages go to <strong>%(target)s points</strong>."
msgstr "每位玩家各自升级，就像即时战略游戏：支付费用，等待研究完成，新时代会带来分数和优势。带时代的对局目标为 <strong>%(target)s 分</strong>。"

msgid "Age"
msgstr "时代"

msgid "Needs"
msgstr "条件"

msgid "Gives"
msgstr "奖励"

msgid "%(n)s s of research"
msgstr "研究 %(n)s 秒"

msgid "%(n)s city"
msgid_plural "%(n)s cities"
msgstr[0] "%(n)s 座城市"

msgid "+%(n)s point"
msgid_plural "+%(n)s points"
msgstr[0] "+%(n)s 分"

msgid "Every age gives +%(fish)s fish for each of your buildings on a fishing ground when it produces, and lets you keep %(limit)s more resource safe from the robber on a 7."
msgstr "每个时代让你在渔场上的每座建筑在渔场产出时多得 %(fish)s 条鱼，并且掷出 7 时可多保留 %(limit)s 张资源不被强盗夺走。"

msgid "You build faster: %(p2)s%% of the normal time in the Age of the Sea and %(p3)s%% in the Golden Age."
msgstr "建造更快：海洋时代为正常时间的 %(p2)s%%，黄金时代为 %(p3)s%%。"

msgid "The megacity can only be built from age %(age)s on."
msgstr "大都市只能在时代 %(age)s 及以后建造。"

msgid "From age %(age)s on, a player holding at least %(n)s fish pays the robber those %(n)s fish instead of losing other resources."
msgstr "从时代 %(age)s 起，持有至少 %(n)s 条鱼的玩家可以用这 %(n)s 条鱼打发强盗，而不损失其他资源。"

msgid "You can cancel a research: part of the cost comes back, as with a building."
msgstr "你可以取消研究：和建筑一样，会退还部分费用。"

msgid "Fish is what you need most: settle next to fishing grounds early."
msgstr "鱼是你最需要的：尽早在渔场旁定居。"

msgid "A settler on the island with its gathering number under it, and the Settler button in the bottom bar."
msgstr "岛上的开拓者，下方显示其采集数字；底部栏有“开拓者”按钮。"

msgid "The number under your settler is the roll it gathers on; the Settler button buys another."
msgstr "开拓者下方的数字是它采集的点数；“开拓者”按钮可再买一个。"

msgid "In the classic game your settler leaves after the first settlements. With settlers, they stay on the island all game:"
msgstr "在经典玩法中，开拓者在最初的村庄建好后离开。开启开拓者后，他们整局都留在岛上："

msgid "Every building needs one of your settlers standing on the spot until it is finished."
msgstr "每次建造都需要你的一名开拓者站在该位置直到完工。"

msgid "Buy more settlers for %(cost)s. You may have %(per)s per settlement and %(city)s per city."
msgstr "花 %(cost)s 购买更多开拓者。每个村庄可拥有 %(per)s 名，每座城市 %(city)s 名。"

msgid "A settler at rest gathers from the hexes around it when its number is rolled: your first settler on the first number, the second on the next, and so on (%(rolls)s)."
msgstr "静止的开拓者在掷出其数字时从周围六边形采集：第一名开拓者对应第一个数字，第二名对应下一个，依此类推（%(rolls)s）。"

msgid "The robber cannot move onto a hex with one of your settlers on a corner."
msgstr "强盗不能移动到角上站着你的开拓者的六边形。"

msgid "Settlers walk faster on your own roads."
msgstr "开拓者在你自己的道路上走得更快。"

msgid "Settlers gather from age %(g)s on and keep the robber away from age %(b)s on."
msgstr "开拓者从时代 %(g)s 起采集，从时代 %(b)s 起驱离强盗。"

msgid "A hidden island: a light line surrounds the land in sight; land seen before is behind a veil of mist."
msgstr "隐藏岛屿：一条浅色线围住视野内的土地；之前见过的土地蒙着一层薄雾。"

msgid "The light line marks what you see now; the misty land you saw before."
msgstr "浅色线标出你现在看到的范围；有雾的是你之前看到过的土地。"

msgid "The island starts covered in mist. You see the land around your buildings, roads and settlers, and it stays on your map once seen."
msgstr "岛屿一开始被迷雾覆盖。你能看到自己建筑、道路和开拓者周围的土地，见过的土地会留在地图上。"

msgid "<strong>Growing sight</strong>: your settler reveals land where it stops."
msgstr "<strong>逐步扩展的视野</strong>：开拓者在停下的地方揭示土地。"

msgid "<strong>Explored</strong>: your settler also reveals land as it walks."
msgstr "<strong>已探索区域</strong>：开拓者行走时也会揭示土地。"

msgid "<strong>Live fog</strong>: like Explored, but on land out of sight you only see other players' buildings as you last saw them."
msgstr "<strong>实时迷雾</strong>：同“已探索区域”，但视野外的土地上只能看到你上次看到时其他玩家的建筑。"

msgid "A light line surrounds your field of vision, what you see right now. Land you saw before but do not see now stays under a light veil."
msgstr "一条浅色线围住你的视野，即你此刻能看到的范围。之前见过但现在看不到的土地蒙着一层薄纱。"

msgid "Numbers show by default. With hidden numbers, you only see the numbers you discover yourself: next to your buildings or where your settlers stand. The ones other players find stay hidden for you."
msgstr "默认显示数字。开启隐藏数字后，你只能看到自己发现的数字：在你的建筑旁或你的开拓者所在处。其他玩家发现的数字对你仍然隐藏。"

msgid "When the game ends, the mist lifts for everyone."
msgstr "对局结束时，所有人的迷雾都会散去。"

msgid "<strong>Friendly robber</strong>: the robber leaves alone anyone with fewer than %(n)s points, and what it takes goes back to the bank."
msgstr "<strong>友善强盗</strong>：强盗不打扰分数少于 %(n)s 的玩家，抢走的资源回到银行。"

msgid "<strong>Fast and big games</strong>: Blitz rolls the dice more often; Big and Huge islands are for more players."
msgstr "<strong>快速与大型对局</strong>：闪电战掷骰更频繁；大岛和超大岛适合更多玩家。"

msgid "<strong>Custom</strong>: start from any game type and change any rule. Share it as a code so your friends play the same rules."
msgstr "<strong>自定义</strong>：从任意对局类型出发并修改任何规则。以代码分享，让朋友用同样的规则游戏。"

msgid "Largest Population: settlers needed"
msgstr "最多人口：所需开拓者数"

msgid "<strong>Largest population</strong>: %(points)s points for whoever has the most settlers (at least %(min)s). It works like the longest road: a tie keeps it where it is. It is played in every game with settlers, with or without ages."
msgstr "<strong>最多人口</strong>：开拓者最多者得 %(points)s 分（至少 %(min)s 名）。规则同最长道路：平局时保持不变。所有有开拓者的对局都适用，无论是否开启时代。"

msgid "An award, like the Longest Road, for the player with the most settlers. Only in games where settlers stay after setup."
msgstr "像最长道路一样，奖励开拓者最多的玩家。仅在开拓者于初始布置后留下的对局中生效。"

msgid "Know the classic game? <a href=\"%(url)s\">Read about the variations</a>: ages, settlers and the hidden island."
msgstr "已经熟悉经典玩法？<a href=\"%(url)s\">阅读变体说明</a>：时代、开拓者和隐藏岛屿。"

msgid "Development of the Sea (tier II)"
msgstr "海洋发展卡（II级）"

msgid "Golden development (tier III)"
msgstr "黄金发展卡（III级）"

msgid "Advanced developments: a deck for each age"
msgstr "进阶发展卡：每个时代一副牌"

msgid "Developments of the Sea (tier II) in the deck"
msgstr "牌堆中的海洋发展卡（II级）"

msgid "Golden developments (tier III) in the deck"
msgstr "牌堆中的黄金发展卡（III级）"

msgid "Hexes a veteran knight moves the robber"
msgstr "老兵骑士移动强盗的格数"

msgid "Hexes an elite knight moves the robber"
msgstr "精英骑士移动强盗的格数"

msgid "Cards a veteran or elite knight steals"
msgstr "老兵或精英骑士偷取的牌数"

msgid "Cards it steals from a player over the robber's limit"
msgstr "从超过强盗上限的玩家处偷取的牌数"

msgid "Rolls a fishing fleet lasts"
msgstr "捕鱼船队持续的掷骰次数"

msgid "Extra fish per building from a fishing fleet"
msgstr "捕鱼船队使每座建筑额外获得的鱼"

msgid "Rolls a merchant lasts"
msgstr "商人持续的掷骰次数"

msgid "Rolls a great market lasts"
msgstr "大市场持续的掷骰次数"

msgid "Bank trade ratio with a merchant or great market"
msgstr "商人或大市场生效时与银行的兑换比例"

msgid "Longest an effect can grow when played again (%)"
msgstr "再次使用时效果最多延长到（%）"

msgid "Roads from a causeway"
msgstr "堤道给予的道路"

msgid "Resources from a bountiful harvest"
msgstr "大丰收给予的资源"

msgid "Most fish from a bountiful harvest"
msgstr "大丰收最多给予的鱼"

msgid "Rolls an architect lasts"
msgstr "建筑师持续的掷骰次数"

msgid "Cards an architect takes off a city or megacity"
msgstr "建筑师为城市或大都市减免的牌数"

msgid "Cards each player ahead gives with a tribute"
msgstr "进贡时每位领先玩家给出的牌数"

msgid "Veteran knight"
msgstr "老兵骑士"

msgid "Fishing fleet"
msgstr "捕鱼船队"

msgid "Merchant"
msgstr "商人"

msgid "Causeway"
msgstr "堤道"

msgid "Bountiful harvest"
msgstr "大丰收"

msgid "Elite knight"
msgstr "精英骑士"

msgid "Architect"
msgstr "建筑师"

msgid "Great market"
msgstr "大市场"

msgid "Tribute"
msgstr "进贡"

msgid "Each age opens a new deck of developments: in the Age of the Sea, developments of the Sea (%(c2)s) with a veteran knight, fishing fleet, merchant, causeway and bountiful harvest; in the Golden Age, golden developments (%(c3)s) with an elite knight, architect, great market and tribute. The fleet, the markets and the architect last a few rolls, and everyone sees them."
msgstr "每个时代都会开放一副新的发展卡：海洋时代有海洋发展卡（%(c2)s），包括老兵骑士、捕鱼船队、商人、堤道和大丰收；黄金时代有黄金发展卡（%(c3)s），包括精英骑士、建筑师、大市场和进贡。船队、市场和建筑师的效果持续几次掷骰，所有人都能看到。"
